  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Lich.jpg\" title=\"Shadow Fade Lich\"><img alt=\"Shadow Fade Lich\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"278\" src=\"/images/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Lich.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Monster-_Shadow_Fade_Lich.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Fade Lich</div></div></div>\n<p>Fade Lichs and Fade Lichlords are the primary spellcasters of the Fade race. They have a normal magic bolt attack as well as a chain lightning attack which bounces between targets and has 100% accuracy. \n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Fade\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fade Fire Lich\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Tainted_Grove\" title=\"Tainted Grove\">Tainted Grove</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Overlord's_Sepulcher\" title=\"Overlord's Sepulcher\">Overlord's Sepulcher</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Forest\" title=\"Dark Forest\">Dark Forest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fire Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">J'aymez Fatfilled's Pad</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Toe-Knee-Eye-Ow-My-Eye's Pad</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ebon Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a> Level 1-4,6,7, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>, level 5 - 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Volcanic Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>The <a href=\"/wiki/Embercore_Path\" title=\"Embercore Path\">Embercore Path</a>, level 1 - 4, <a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Crypts\" title=\"Demonic Crypts\">Demonic Crypts</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ice Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arctic Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Supply Depot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Fade Lichlord *\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Crypts\" title=\"Demonic Crypts\">Demonic Crypts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Lichlord\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>,<a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>, level 5 - 7, <a href=\"/wiki/Demonic_Crypts\" title=\"Demonic Crypts\">Demonic Crypts</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Fade Lich\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Abyss Milll</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Grave Forge</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Plague_Plant\" title=\"Plague Plant\">Plague Plant</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Specials\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Specials</span></h2>\n<p><b>Crypt Kickers</b> are Fire Fade General and Volcanic Lichlord <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Champions\" title=\"Category:Champions\">Champions</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">J'aymz Fatfilled's Pad</a>.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Notes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>* Divine Fade Lichlords in <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> have been observed to spawn <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Divine Fade Soldier\">Divine Fade Soliders</a>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
